OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain turning light and patchy on
OL,7,FWednesday then mainly dry and bright
OL,8,Fon Thursday. Another band of rain and
OL,9,Fhill snow arriving on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
